        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-mojavensis-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-segment-ks-activator-vs-plate>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-mojavensis-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-plate-circularity>,
