    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-mojavensis-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg most-unstable wavelength for D. mojavensis epicuticle at 2.4 µm (0 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 83.8/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1. Schnakenberg kinetics a=0.37, b=0.71, γ=4, R=Dv/Du=80. Diffusivities are scaled so argmax σ(k) is 2.380 µm (catalog 2.4 µm = 2.38e-06 m). PDE-measured σ(k) vs analytic σ(k): Pearson r=0.99323, RMSE=0.02405 (n=9). Saturated radial-FFT wavelength 2.414 µm. Equal-diffusion ablation std ratio 2.5e-6. Analytic λ★(s) is monotone on s in {0.67, 0.85, 1, 1.40, 1.85}. Chronoseries at 0 Ma, λ ∝ √D: D. miranda 3.236 µm, D. mojavensis 2.380 µm, D. novamexicana 1.948 µm. GIF 14 frames, 640×480, CV similarity 87.1 against the canonical gallery plate. Pattern weight 0.18 chosen from {0.06, 0.10, 0.14, 0.18}. Overall 83.8/100 (faithfulness 82.7, reproducibility 86.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0e0828eed603126b2ece796473b70906c8bb4076; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 86, Morphological realism / specimen match 80, Parameter expressivity 84, Morphometric validation 82, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 82, Reproducibility package 86. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_mojavensis_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-mojavensis-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0e0828eed603126b2ece796473b70906c8bb4076, image/png, 491888 B, 1512×984 px, artifact_sha256 33eeba72316e26acf05bde40511d05c5fba8645851653c61c93b7241b21bfa3f (sha256 33eeba72316e26acf05bde40511d05c5fba8645851653c61c93b7241b21bfa3f), spec_fingerprint b1989635e560992257bdc385b54a49911ad758777fefbeab3e3411ca482c2805. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: b1989635e560992257bdc385b54a49911ad758777fefbeab3e3411ca482c2805; artifact_sha256: 33eeba72316e26acf05bde40511d05c5fba8645851653c61c93b7241b21bfa3f; input_dataset_sha256: {drosophila_mojavensis_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=7ab7a539471b2219..., drosophila_mojavensis_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=f68e7b21de8d6b97..., drosophila_mojavensis_wikimedia_female.png=7615839cbc796270...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 diffusion-driven instability and linear dispersion | Schnakenberg 1979 two-species kinetics | Matzkin et al. 2006 and 2012, Allan & Matzkin 2019: cactus-host differentiation in D. mojavensis | Drosophila 12 Genomes Consortium 2007 placed D. mojavensis in the repleta group; reconstructed_in_script: Du and Dv calibrated so the most-unstable wavelength equals 2.38e-06 m | Chronospecies wavelengths via λ ∝ √D at fixed Jacobian and R=80 (3237 nm, 2380 nm, 1948 nm) | Activator composited onto the canonical gallery plate for the GIF; transfer_boundary: Campaign chronoseries lists D. miranda as predecessor and D. novamexicana as successor at 0 Ma; that is not a cladogram | The 2.4 µm length is the catalog detail tier, not a length reported in the Matzkin papers; does_not_claim: That 2.38 µm was read off a D. mojavensis micrograph in the cited papers | That the gallery plate's 100 µm scale bar is this slot's phenomenon scale | That DOI 10.1534/genetics.106.059444 is a Matzkin cactus paper (Crossref: Hill & Otto 2007, yeast)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "open need [model_equation/model-fidelity, pressure P=1.1]: Neumann boundary has not been integrated; only the periodic Laplacian is exercised.",
        "open need [parameter_sweep/parameter-expressivity, pressure P=1.3]: Saturated FFT wavelength at s≠1 is not yet measured.",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R1', 'item': 'Add a no-flux (Neumann) boundary control and report its saturated wavelength next to the periodic λ.'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R2', 'item': 'Measure the saturated FFT wavelength at the predecessor and successor diffusivity scales, not only the analytic λ★(s).'}" ;
    pk:hasScore 8.38e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-mojavensis-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg most-unstable wavelength for D. mojavensis epicuticle at 2.4 µm (0 Ma) — Parameter expressivity: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "λ★(s) increases monotonically for diffusivity scales 0.67, 0.85, 1, 1.40, 1.85 at fixed Jacobian, which is the claimed square-root control. The saturated FFT wavelength is measured only at s=1 (2.414 µm vs λ★ 2.380 µm). The equal-diffusion ablation collapses the amplitude (std ratio 2.5e-6)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/parameter-expressivity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-mojavensis-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-mojavensis-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-mojavensis-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

