<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-mojavensis-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg most-unstable wavelength for D. mojavensis epicuticle at 2.4 µm (0 Ma) — Morphological realism / specimen match: 80/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The 14-frame 640×480 GIF ends on the canonical plate with a 0.18 activator modulation. Computer-vision similarity to that plate is 87.1. The plate is a stylized ochre spiral with a 100 µm bar, not a 2.4 µm micrograph, so the match is to the repository specimen asset rather than to a published SEM. The public-domain habitus (225×99) is segmented but not the fitness target." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
